WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.416 --> 00:00:33.000
<b>In the previous several verses, Lord Krishna</b>

2
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.916
<b>spoke about various types of </b>
<b>sacrifices and renunciation.</b>

3
00:00:36.916 --> 00:00:42.375
<b>He also told that the Vedas contain a </b>
<b>detailed description of these sacrifices,</b>

4
00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:48.625
<b>and the main objective of all of them is</b>
<b>to attain liberation through action.</b>

5
00:00:48.625 --> 00:00:51.583
<b>Now this verse is extremely important,</b>

6
00:00:51.583 --> 00:00:52.916
<b>because here Lord Krishna</b>

7
00:00:52.916 --> 00:00:57.958
<b>is telling about the best method of performing </b>
<b>these sacrifices and renunciation.</b>

8
00:01:03.125 --> 00:01:05.875
<b>In this verse, Lord Krishna tells Arjuna</b>

9
00:01:05.875 --> 00:01:10.708
<b>that the sacrifice or renunciation performed </b>
<b>with proper knowledge and awareness</b>

10
00:01:10.708 --> 00:01:16.541
<b>is far superior to the mere renunciation </b>
<b>of material wealth or actions.</b>

11
00:01:16.541 --> 00:01:21.541
<b>And ultimately, the purpose of </b>
<b>sacrifice is also to attain knowledge.</b>

12
00:01:21.541 --> 00:01:26.458
<b>This means that right knowledge will awaken </b>
<b>the right sentiment in that sacrifice,</b>

13
00:01:26.458 --> 00:01:31.541
<b>and then while performing that very sacrifice, </b>
<b>man's spiritual progress will happen,</b>

14
00:01:31.541 --> 00:01:35.458
<b>he will attain the depth of spiritual knowledge.</b>

15
00:01:35.458 --> 00:01:38.666
<b>Look how beautiful this cycle is.</b>

16
00:01:38.666 --> 00:01:41.166
<b>With right knowledge you perform the sacrifice,</b>

17
00:01:41.166 --> 00:01:46.916
<b>and then that very sacrifice further </b>
<b>enhances your spiritual knowledge.</b>

18
00:01:46.916 --> 00:01:48.375
<b>The essence of renunciation is</b>

19
00:01:48.375 --> 00:01:54.458
<b>to acquire knowledge for self-realization </b>
<b>and God-realization,</b>

20
00:01:54.458 --> 00:01:57.500
<b>and then to apply that knowledge in life.</b>

21
00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:05.041
<b>This very path elevates man above worldly</b>
<b>bondage and paves the way for his liberation.</b>

22
00:02:05.041 --> 00:02:09.375
<b>The meaning of sacrifice performed with </b>
<b>knowledge is that we should renounce,</b>

23
00:02:09.375 --> 00:02:13.541
<b>but we should do so by understanding </b>
<b>the inherent spiritual principles.</b>

24
00:02:13.541 --> 00:02:17.083
<b>This will lead us towards our spiritual truth</b>

25
00:02:17.083 --> 00:02:21.291
<b>and will also orient us towards God-realization.</b>

26
00:02:21.291 --> 00:02:25.916
<b>For example, a wealthy person </b>
<b>makes a large donation,</b>

27
00:02:25.916 --> 00:02:30.416
<b>but then also expects applause in return.</b>

28
00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:31.791
<b>Here there is renunciation,</b>

29
00:02:31.791 --> 00:02:36.500
<b>but it is being done as a profitable activity.</b>

30
00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:40.750
<b>Here both the sentiment and the </b>
<b>spiritual principle are absent.</b>

31
00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:43.833
<b>On the other hand, there is </b>
<b>someone who is not wealthy,</b>

32
00:02:43.833 --> 00:02:46.291
<b>and can only make a small donation,</b>

33
00:02:46.291 --> 00:02:48.916
<b>but the objective is the welfare of someone else,</b>

34
00:02:48.916 --> 00:02:51.666
<b>and the sentiment in the mind is of renunciation.</b>

35
00:02:51.666 --> 00:02:57.375
<b>So here, this sentiment, this spiritual knowledge </b>
<b>makes that renunciation meritorious.</b>

36
00:02:57.375 --> 00:03:02.416
<b>Sacrifices performed without knowledge </b>
<b>remain limited to the material level</b>

37
00:03:02.416 --> 00:03:05.291
<b>and do not provide real spiritual advancement.</b>

38
00:03:05.291 --> 00:03:09.500
<b>Right knowledge and sentiment make </b>
<b>the sacrifice excellent.</b>

39
00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:14.916
<b>Lord Krishna is inspiring Arjuna</b>
<b>here to prioritize knowledge.</b>

40
00:03:14.916 --> 00:03:20.833
<b>This knowledge will purify the intellect and </b>
<b>take Arjuna to such a spiritual level</b>

41
00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:25.791
<b>where all actions and sacrifices lead to liberation.</b>

42
00:03:30.083 --> 00:03:31.666
<b>Right knowledge</b>

43
00:03:31.666 --> 00:03:33.375
<b>and awareness</b>

44
00:03:33.375 --> 00:03:36.958
<b>are extremely necessary for any action.</b>

45
00:03:36.958 --> 00:03:42.791
<b>When we perform actions with right </b>
<b>understanding and a clear objective,</b>

46
00:03:42.791 --> 00:03:45.958
<b>their impact becomes even deeper.</b>

47
00:03:45.958 --> 00:03:49.000
<b>Take the example of spiritual meditation.</b>

48
00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:56.708
<b>If a person does it only because someone </b>
<b>suggested that it will reduce stress,</b>

49
00:03:56.708 --> 00:04:01.416
<b>then that person will do it as just an activity.</b>

50
00:04:01.416 --> 00:04:04.875
<b>He will not be able to reap its full benefits.</b>

51
00:04:04.875 --> 00:04:10.833
<b>On the other hand, someone who also </b>
<b>knows the real knowledge behind it</b>

52
00:04:10.833 --> 00:04:14.208
<b>will do it with full awareness.</b>

53
00:04:14.208 --> 00:04:21.916
<b>He will gradually start to see every aspect </b>
<b>of life from a spiritual perspective.</b>

54
00:04:21.916 --> 00:04:26.291
<b>An action that appears to be a physical activity</b>

55
00:04:26.291 --> 00:04:30.125
<b>becomes excellent due to right knowledge,</b>

56
00:04:30.125 --> 00:04:33.708
<b>it becomes a deep austerity.</b>

57
00:04:33.708 --> 00:04:40.750
<b>Whatever daily activities you do, </b>
<b>do them with spiritual awareness.</b>

58
00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:44.500
<b>Understand the truth hidden behind every ritual.</b>

59
00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:48.000
<b>Awaken the desire for proper</b>
<b>knowledge within you.</b>

60
00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:53.625
<b>This will make your every action purposeful.</b>

61
00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:02.083
<b>Understanding right knowledge </b>
<b>is extremely necessary.</b>

62
00:05:02.083 --> 00:05:04.166
<b>And in the family environment,</b>

63
00:05:04.166 --> 00:05:09.000
<b>a major responsibility for this lies with </b>
<b>the elders of the family.</b>

64
00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:16.875
<b>Just as in every family some cultural </b>
<b>traditions and rituals are followed.</b>

65
00:05:16.875 --> 00:05:19.875
<b>It is necessary for the elders of the family</b>

66
00:05:19.875 --> 00:05:25.458
<b>to also explain the importance behind </b>
<b>these traditions to everyone.</b>

67
00:05:25.458 --> 00:05:29.833
<b>This will also preserve family culture,</b>

68
00:05:29.833 --> 00:05:36.333
<b>because if the coming generation does not </b>
<b>even know the importance of these traditions,</b>

69
00:05:36.333 --> 00:05:40.166
<b>then gradually these traditions </b>
<b>will become extinct.</b>

70
00:05:40.166 --> 00:05:42.833
<b>For example –</b>

71
00:05:42.833 --> 00:05:49.625
<b>in many homes there is a tradition </b>
<b>of lighting a lamp every evening.</b>

72
00:05:49.625 --> 00:05:52.958
<b>Is this just an ordinary routine?</b>

73
00:05:52.958 --> 00:05:54.541
<b>No.</b>

74
00:05:54.541 --> 00:05:58.166
<b>It is a metaphor for dispelling</b>
<b>the darkness of ignorance</b>

75
00:05:58.166 --> 00:06:04.458
<b>and kindling the light of knowledge and purity.</b>

76
00:06:04.458 --> 00:06:06.750
<b>Every evening, while lighting the lamp</b>

77
00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:12.125
<b>just remembering this, can become </b>
<b>a message of inspiration.</b>

78
00:06:12.125 --> 00:06:21.833
<b>It is important for elders to openly discuss </b>
<b>the purposes behind each tradition in the family.</b>

79
00:06:21.833 --> 00:06:25.041
<b>This will also remove </b>
<b>misconceptions of the youth,</b>

80
00:06:25.041 --> 00:06:30.666
<b>and respect for their own culture will </b>
<b>also increase in the coming generation.</b>

81
00:06:30.666 --> 00:06:36.083
<b>And this very respect will then become </b>
<b>the inspiration for the preservation of culture.</b>

82
00:06:36.083 --> 00:06:37.708
<b>Think about it.</b>

83
00:06:42.125 --> 00:06:45.250
<b>Knowledge of the right objective.</b>

84
00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:52.041
<b>Perhaps nothing is more important than </b>
<b>this in the professional environment.</b>

85
00:06:52.041 --> 00:06:54.041
<b>Consider it yourself.</b>

86
00:06:54.041 --> 00:06:58.958
<b>A business organization is such an important unit,</b>

87
00:06:58.958 --> 00:07:04.500
<b>every business has such a big contribution </b>
<b>in the progress of the country.</b>

88
00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:08.000
<b>Hundreds of people work together there.</b>

89
00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:14.333
<b>But if the employees are unaware of </b>
<b>the objectives of the organization,</b>

90
00:07:14.333 --> 00:07:18.375
<b>they will always consider their </b>
<b>contribution to be small.</b>

91
00:07:18.375 --> 00:07:20.208
<b>And on the other hand,</b>

92
00:07:20.208 --> 00:07:28.916
<b>if the senior officials of that organization </b>
<b>regularly remind everyone of the main objective,</b>

93
00:07:28.916 --> 00:07:32.500
<b>then every employee will not </b>
<b>only do his work better,</b>

94
00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:39.875
<b>but will also consider himself a participant </b>
<b>in the progress of the country.</b>

95
00:07:39.875 --> 00:07:42.375
<b>What a beautiful perspective this is.</b>

96
00:07:42.375 --> 00:07:46.083
<b>Every organization is working for </b>
<b>the progress of the country.</b>

97
00:07:46.083 --> 00:07:49.583
<b>It is simplifying the life of </b>
<b>some customer or the other.</b>

98
00:07:49.583 --> 00:07:52.458
<b>The only requirement is that</b>

99
00:07:52.458 --> 00:07:57.500
<b>the objectives of the organization should be </b>
<b>seen from the perspective of human welfare,</b>

100
00:07:57.500 --> 00:08:02.375
<b>senior officials should apprise</b>
<b>everyone of these objectives.</b>

101
00:08:02.375 --> 00:08:07.583
<b>Everyone should be told how </b>
<b>important their contribution is.</b>

102
00:08:07.583 --> 00:08:10.291
<b>When people understand this,</b>

103
00:08:10.291 --> 00:08:12.583
<b>they will work with more dedication,</b>

104
00:08:12.583 --> 00:08:18.750
<b>they will see their work and </b>
<b>themselves from a new perspective.</b>

105
00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:22.250
<b>Not only will their productivity increase,</b>

106
00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:26.666
<b>but the organization will </b>
<b>also progress along with it.</b>

